        "original_id": "2020bd5f-3281-511f-ae1c-7042a40f7412",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wayne Coyne, Robert Palmer, Mark Coyne\n- Organizations: The Flaming Lips\n- Products: Hear It Is\n- Roles: lead singer, backing vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, theremin player, songwriter\n- Concepts: musical styles, vocal debut\n\nFacts:\n- Wayne Coyne became the vocalist on Hear It Is after his brother Mark departed.\n- Wayne Coyne is the lead singer, occasional backing vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, theremin player, and songwriter for The Flaming Lips.\n- Robert Palmer was known for his distinctive soulful voice, eclectic album styles spanning soul, jazz, rock, pop, reggae, and blues, and sartorial acumen.",
